  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "s1_sub_013_picnic_01",
      "hash64": "686A77A477DFA3BC",
      "text": "从帕底亚来的这位同学！\\c\\n叔叔我会出于兴趣\\n自己制作椅子。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "s1_sub_013_picnic_02",
      "hash64": "686A7AA477DFA8D5",
      "text": "我正在烦恼要怎样设计\\n才能让椅子在野餐时好用呢。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "s1_sub_013_picnic_03",
      "hash64": "686A79A477DFA722",
      "text": "如果你不介意的话，\\n可以给我看看你的桌巾吗？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "s1_sub_013_picnic_15",
      "hash64": "6866F7A477DC9465",
      "text": "你是不是对野餐\\n没有太大兴趣呀……？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "s1_sub_013_system_01",
      "hash64": "D5DB6D5A6682BFF9",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)]给叔叔\\n看了桌巾！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
