        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "s1_sub_013_picnic_04",
      "hash64": "686A74A477DF9EA3",
      "text": "嗯嗯，原来如此！\\n在帕底亚有这样的设计……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "s1_sub_013_picnic_16",
      "hash64": "6866F4A477DC8F4C",
      "text": "那我就以你给我看的设计为基础\\n赶快来做做新椅子吧！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "s1_sub_013_picnic_16_s",
      "hash64": "7AEE7758E356A98E",
      "text": "那我就以你给我看的设计为基础\\n赶快来做做新椅子吧！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "s1_sub_013_picnic_17",
      "hash64": "6866F5A477DC90FF",
      "text": "哼哈哼哈哼哈！……椅咂～！！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "s1_sub_013_picnic_05",
      "hash64": "686A73A477DF9CF0",
      "text": "……试制品完成了！\\c\\n总之这把椅子就先\\n作为谢礼送给你了！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 9,
