    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "s1_sub_013_picnic_18",
      "hash64": "6866FAA477DC997E",
      "text": "呼～多亏了你，\\n我才能做出这么多新椅子，\\r\\n多到已经做不出新花样啦。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
