    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "s1_sub_013_picnicnpc_01_01",
      "hash64": "35EB04F903989665",
      "text": "肚子饿了没呀？\\n如果不介意的话就分给你一些吧。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "s1_sub_013_picnicnpc_01_02",
      "hash64": "35EB01F90398914C",
      "text": "在北上的大自然中吃的三明治\\n可是别有一番风味哦。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "s1_sub_013_picnicnpc_01_06",
      "hash64": "35EAFDF903988A80",
      "text": "你的体力还够吗？\\n如果不介意的话就休息一下吧。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "s1_sub_013_picnicnpc_01_03",
      "hash64": "35EB02F9039892FF",
      "text": "冒险累了吗？\\n如果不介意的话就休息一下吧。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "label": "s1_sub_013_picnicnpc_01_04",
      "hash64": "35EAFFF903988DE6",
      "text": "３个人一起热热闹闹的真好啊。\\n欢迎你随时再来哦。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "label": "s1_sub_013_picnicnpc_01_05",
      "hash64": "35EB00F903988F99",
      "text": "我暂时会待在这里，\\n你要是累了就来找我吧。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "label": "s2_sub_013_picnic_chair_01",
      "hash64": "8FC820AC036A8763",
      "text": "哦？你好像又有\\n新的桌巾了呀。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
